    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WARNING: This game contains flashing lights, loud sounds, and lots of jumpscares.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wallway is a cooperative first-person horror game for 1-5 players. Explore endless hallways, collect important items and find your way out. Run away from the terrible monster that hears your every sound through the microphone. Can you escape or are you consumed by darkness and fear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253990/extras/8f9e12726f3263e97d050f6e0a2da964.avif?t=1753650255\" width=800 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is your challenge?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wallway takes place in endless corridors where there are several different items that allow you to get out of the endless corridors and also help you defend yourself against the killer who decides to kill you and maybe even succeeds. Be careful though, the killer can hear your voice from the microphone, so you have to be quiet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253990/extras/5d3ea5d4b8329543393ec8119733e557.avif?t=1753650255\" width=800 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you do it?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playability</strong><br>The Wallway has simple controls for surviving in the cornfield yet everything will be explained to you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online co-op for 1-5 players</strong><br>You can play The Wallway alone or together with your friends. Up to 5 of you can play together.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repeatability</strong><br>The full version of The Wallway offers many different maps and game modes. You'll never find yourself running out of things to do, thanks to random events you'll be scared forever.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes and Difficulty</strong><br>In addition to several The Wallway maps, the full version also offers several game modes and difficulties.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features in multiplayer mode</strong><br>Take advantage of voice chat that reacts to distance from others. Be careful though, the killer can hear you too and will come after you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253990/extras/5582506dd0319c76bd162dfd5e2d16f8.avif?t=1753650255\" width=800 height=320 /></span> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the single player mode, The Wallway also offers multiplayer for up to 5 players. In some situations, you'll have to work together to survive this nightmare and escape without getting killed by the monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253990/extras/b9489f5ba395a1f85663db512c19e4be.avif?t=1753650255\" width=800 height=320 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WARNING: This game contains flashing lights, loud sounds, and lots of jumpscares.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wallway is a cooperative first-person horror game for 1-5 players. Explore endless hallways, collect important items and find your way out. Run away from the terrible monster that hears your every sound through the microphone. Can you escape or are you consumed by darkness and fear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253990/extras/8f9e12726f3263e97d050f6e0a2da964.avif?t=1753650255\" width=800 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is your challenge?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wallway takes place in endless corridors where there are several different items that allow you to get out of the endless corridors and also help you defend yourself against the killer who decides to kill you and maybe even succeeds. Be careful though, the killer can hear your voice from the microphone, so you have to be quiet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253990/extras/5d3ea5d4b8329543393ec8119733e557.avif?t=1753650255\" width=800 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you do it?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playability</strong><br>The Wallway has simple controls for surviving in the cornfield yet everything will be explained to you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online co-op for 1-5 players</strong><br>You can play The Wallway alone or together with your friends. Up to 5 of you can play together.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repeatability</strong><br>The full version of The Wallway offers many different maps and game modes. You'll never find yourself running out of things to do, thanks to random events you'll be scared forever.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes and Difficulty</strong><br>In addition to several The Wallway maps, the full version also offers several game modes and difficulties.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features in multiplayer mode</strong><br>Take advantage of voice chat that reacts to distance from others. Be careful though, the killer can hear you too and will come after you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253990/extras/5582506dd0319c76bd162dfd5e2d16f8.avif?t=1753650255\" width=800 height=320 /></span> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the single player mode, The Wallway also offers multiplayer for up to 5 players. In some situations, you'll have to work together to survive this nightmare and escape without getting killed by the monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253990/extras/b9489f5ba395a1f85663db512c19e4be.avif?t=1753650255\" width=800 height=320 /></span></p>",
